">Fill out the form below to explore sponsorship opportunities. We&#x27;ll get back to you with a custom proposal.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" style=\"padding:4rem 0\"><div class=\"container\"><form class=\"vendor-application-form\" style=\"max-width:900px;margin:0 auto\" action=\"\" encType=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"POST\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_REF_1\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_1:0\" value=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;606e60775d4e5512e3b944ec419a845c4b233ce17b&quot;,&quot;bound&quot;:&quot;$@1&quot;}\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_1:1\" value=\"[{&quot;message&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;success&quot;:false}]\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_KEY\" value=\"k8043a508f3f9041da9f6a24444d73aef\"/><div class=\"form-section\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.5rem\"><h3 class=\"form-section-title\" style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#666;margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--color-yellow)\">Company Information</h3><div class=\"form-row\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"company_name\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Company Name *</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"company_name\" required=\"\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\" name=\"company_name\"/></div><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"website\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Company Website</label><input type=\"url\" id=\"website\" placeholder=\"https://yourcompany.com\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\" name=\"website\"/></div></div><div class=\"form-row\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"industry\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Industry</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"industry\" placeholder=\"e.g., Gaming, Retail, Food &amp; Beverage\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\" name=\"industry\"/></div><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"company_size\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Company Size</label><select id=\"company_size\" name=\"company_size\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\"><option value=\"\">Select size...</option><option value=\"1-10 employees\">1-10 employees</option><option value=\"11-50 employees\">11-50 employees</option><option value=\"51-200 employees\">51-200 employees</option><option value=\"201-500 employees\">201-500 employees</option><option value=\"500+ employees\">500+ employees</option></select></div></div></div><div class=\"form-section\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.5rem\"><h3 class=\"form-section-title\" style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#666;margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--color-yellow)\">Contact Information</h3><div class=\"form-row\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"contact_name\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Contact Name *</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"contact_name\" required=\"\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\" name=\"contact_name\"/></div><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"contact_position\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Position/Title</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"contact_position\" placeholder=\"e.g., Marketing Director, CEO\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\" name=\"contact_position\"/></div></div><div class=\"form-row\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"contact_email\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Email Address *</label><input type=\"email\" id=\"contact_email\" required=\"\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\" name=\"contact_email\"/></div><div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"contact_phone\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Phone Number</label><input type=\"tel\" id=\"contact_phone\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\" name=\"contact_phone\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"form-section\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.5rem\"><h3 class=\"form-section-title\" style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#666;margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--color-yellow)\">Sponsorship Details</h3><div class=\"form-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><label for=\"sponsorship_tier\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Preferred Sponsorship Tier</label><select id=\"sponsorship_tier\" name=\"sponsorship_tier\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\"><option value=\"\">Select a tier...</option><option value=\"platinum\">Platinum ($5,000+)</option><option value=\"gold\">Gold ($2,500+)</option><option value=\"silver\">Silver ($1,000+)</option><option value=\"custom\">Custom</option></select></div><div class=\"form-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><label class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.75rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Sponsorship Interests * (Select all that apply)</label><div class=\"checkbox-group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0.75rem\"><label class=\"checkbox-label\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;padding:1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s\"><input type=\"checkbox\" style=\"margin-top:0.25rem;accent-color:var(--color-yellow)\" name=\"sponsorship_interest\" value=\"Event Sponsorship\"/><div><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark);display:block\">Event Sponsorship</span><span style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#666\">Sponsor the entire event or specific areas</span></div></label><label class=\"checkbox-label\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;padding:1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s\"><input type=\"checkbox\" style=\"margin-top:0.25rem;accent-color:var(--color-yellow)\" name=\"sponsorship_interest\" value=\"Prize Donation\"/><div><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark);display:block\">Prize Donation</span><span style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#666\">Provide prizes for tournaments/raffles</span></div></label><label class=\"checkbox-label\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;padding:1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s\"><input type=\"checkbox\" style=\"margin-top:0.25rem;accent-color:var(--color-yellow)\" name=\"sponsorship_interest\" value=\"Workshop Hosting\"/><div><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark);display:block\">Workshop Hosting</span><span style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#666\">Host educational workshops</span></div></label><label class=\"checkbox-label\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;padding:1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s\"><input type=\"checkbox\" style=\"margin-top:0.25rem;accent-color:var(--color-yellow)\" name=\"sponsorship_interest\" value=\"Panel Speaking\"/><div><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark);display:block\">Panel Speaking</span><span style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#666\">Participate in expert panels</span></div></label><label class=\"checkbox-label\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;padding:1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s\"><input type=\"checkbox\" style=\"margin-top:0.25rem;accent-color:var(--color-yellow)\" name=\"sponsorship_interest\" value=\"Brand Activation\"/><div><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark);display:block\">Brand Activation</span><span style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:#666\">Interactive brand experience booth</span></div></label></div></div><div class=\"form-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><label for=\"budget_range\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-dark)\">Budget Range</label><select id=\"budget_range\" name=\"budget_range\" class=\"form-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border:2px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:1rem;transition:border-color 0.2s\"><option value=\"\">Select budget range...</option><option value=\"$1,000 - $2,500\">$1,000 - $2,500</